  {
    "label": "figure_title",
    "text": "Figure 1. Comparison between BH accretion and halo-scale mass inflow for the 107 M PBH runs. The top panel shows the BH accretion rate, M•, while the middle and bottom pan- els show the gas and dark-matter inflow rates measured at the virial radius, Mgas,in(Rvir) and MDM,in(Rvir). The bot- tom axis gives cosmic time, and the top axis gives the corre- sponding redshift. The overdense runs show larger halo-scale inflow and more bursty BH accretion than the isolated case, illustrating the connection between structure formation and PBH fueling.",
